11
00:00:35,610 --> 00:00:38,310
It's an instinctive reaction
to a stimulus.

12
00:00:44,619 --> 00:00:46,149
Stop it, you lunatic.

13
00:00:46,250 --> 00:00:48,390
I could punch you for real.

14
00:00:52,890 --> 00:00:54,560
I told you to stop.

15
00:00:55,659 --> 00:00:57,759
