16
00:01:06,500 --> 00:01:07,610
What's going on?

17
00:01:17,120 --> 00:01:18,420
Put that down!

18
00:01:19,150 --> 00:01:21,319
What do you think you're doing?

19
00:01:21,650 --> 00:01:22,689
Darn it.

20
00:01:22,689 --> 00:01:23,789
