83
00:08:03,190 --> 00:08:04,460
I'll just see you now.

84
00:08:06,520 --> 00:08:08,159
That crazy...

85
00:08:08,229 --> 00:08:10,390
That son of a gun.

86
00:08:12,229 --> 00:08:13,429
- Are they going to fight?
- What?

87
00:08:13,960 --> 00:08:15,229
