235
00:21:52,680 --> 00:21:53,749
Is this the guy?

236
00:21:54,479 --> 00:21:55,989
Are you kidding me?

237
00:21:55,989 --> 00:21:58,759
You should be ashamed. This is a no.

238
00:22:05,229 --> 00:22:06,999
I need to go to cram school.

239
