246
00:22:50,239 --> 00:22:51,239
An Soo Ho.

247
00:22:53,539 --> 00:22:54,579
An Soo Ho.

248
00:22:56,779 --> 00:22:59,579
Jeong Yeong Bin dragged Yeon Si Eun away.

249
00:22:59,779 --> 00:23:00,779
